# Half of the magician's pair. GMS gives it 20 levels at 99+5x; here it is the
# same climb in half the levels, ending where GMS ends.
#
# The ice half, and it leaves two things: Freeze Stacks on the character, and
# eight seconds of freezing on what it hit, both from GMS. The stacks decide how
# much Freezing Crush and Shatter are worth; the freeze decides whether they pay
# at all, and it is all Storm Magic needs. Together they are the whole reason to
# cast the weaker of the two.
name: "Cold Beam"
description:
  "An ice-attribute attack. Grow sharp ice crystals in front. Any enemies "
  "who come in contact with the crystals will freeze."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_ICE
freeze_seconds: 8.0
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_WIZARD skill_order: 1 }
max_level: 10
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 810
max_enemies: 6
lines: 3
base { skill_pct: 1.09 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.10 }
